  "notes": [
    "The gacha-calculator community timeline is secondary. Shared four-star phase rosters do not imply player-selectable multiple 5-star weapons.",
    "Ver.3.7 Phase 1 three 5-star and three 4-star items are directly present in the KURO GAMES 5546 notice, but it states version update instead of explicit clock start.",
    "The Cyberpunk: Edgerunners June 8 4-star roster is also in official KURO GAMES 4844 and 4860 notices.",
    "The community date for March 18 2026 is one day different from site's existing March 19 banner date; phase roster is aligned to March 19 while retaining source_date.",
    "Potential updates after October 12 2026 are excluded. Other dates without a corresponding archived 5-star banner are not admitted automatically.",
    "Seven additional phases on 2025-10-30, 2025-12-25, 2026-01-15, 2026-02-05, 2026-02-26, 2026-04-09, and 2026-04-30 were directly verified for ★5 and ★4 lineups against each applicable KURO GAMES official weapon notice; 21 existing secondary rows can be reclassified as official.",
    "24 additional historical phases from July 2024 to December 2025 have their ★5 and common ★4 featured weapons cross-checked with named KURO GAMES publisher notices; two inaccurate four-star lineups (2025-11-20 and 2025-12-11) corrected to those publisher notices.",
    "For 12 phases where the official announcement gives only 'Version update' instead of an exact local clock start, the four-star contents are first-party verified but the day is still archive-aligned; these have a distinct date_basis and are not claimed to have exact official-date confirmation.",
    "The remaining 2026-03-19 phase's start day has now been corroborated directly by the KURO GAMES 4403 maintenance and 4447 patch notices. Its ★4 rate-up content remains secondary-source because a direct KURO rate-up announcement was not located."
